    "body": "Run `dumpbin.exe /imports` on the cross-built `bitcoind.exe` in the \"Windows, test cross-built\" jobs to list the imported DLLs and to ensure the executable is linked against the expected C runtime.\r\n\r\nThis came up during a discussion in https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35877 ([here](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35877#pullrequestreview-4882577358) and [here](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35877#issuecomment-5217049246)). Inspired by the analogous CI steps in https://github.com/hebasto/bitcoin-core-nightly.",
